57","id":2715137432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h1bWY","user":{"login":"TML233","id":19572238,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NTcyMjM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19572238?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233","html_url":"https://github.com/TML233","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TML233/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T17:21:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T17:25:33Z","body":"> This PR uses GDScripts, which is not a guaranteed feature for custom builds. Is there an alternative way to do this that does not involve GDScript?\r\n\r\nWe can add a build option to disable this. For power users who build their own engine, they can either disable this feature and make their own license notices dialog, or replace the GDScript-powered add-on with ones that are available in their custom builds.\r\nThis license integration tool is typically used by fast prototyping projects and ordinary users that/who uses GDS and official builds.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715137432/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2716219388","html_url":"https://github.c